Try the method of Heise (1972) for calculating the effects of "block variables." In a few steps, you can get the coefficients. I have not tried, but I imagine with some clever constraints in lavaan you could create new parameters representing these quantities and get lavaan to compute the standard errors as well.

http://intersci.ss.uci.edu/wiki/pdf/Heise1972NominalInducedandBlockvarsinregressionanal.pdf

