In a fresh version of R (before loading any packages), you can install the development version of lavaan using:

install.packages("lavaan", repos="http://www.da.ugent.be", type="source")
And you can install the development version of semTools using

install.packages("devtools")
devtools::install_github("simsem/semTools/semTools")
